  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/ad7ed9df0664c8c80a37bbc182d130affcc4cc48.png\" alt=\"Title\"></p>\n<h2>描述📜:</h2>\n<p>该资源包更新了《Ars Nouveau》模组中过时设计的符文、铭牌及其他物品，使其更加丰富多彩，并符合现代 Minecraft 的美术风格。</p>\n<h2>展示🎬:</h2>\n<h3>90+ 个符文已更改</h3>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/0da6a89d9b0dadf4de8fc1f71edf0b1eab527be4.jpeg\" alt=\"Glyphs\"></p>\n<h2>已更改的精华图标</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/fa2056991b2a17f4c92bdd09e55c16d4a218b50f.png\" alt=\"Essences\"></p>\n<h2>已更改的护符与使魔图标</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/bd77cdfbd50df394175900825a27a053e459b2fa.png\" alt=\"Charms &amp; Familiars\"></p>\n<h2>已更改的板卷轴图标</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/266b916efb34a72343854cf6aa5d14e4be1e85a8.png\" alt=\"Tablets\"></p>\n<h2>以及更多...</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/e53b0b84cbefa727ab16a4bf4e8613c123ab483a.png\" alt=\"More items\"></p>\n<h2>路线图📝:</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>更新该模组中生物、武器和盔甲的风格。</li>\n<li>改进《Ars Nouveau》其他附加组件中物品的纹理。</li>\n</ul>",
